    "description": {
      "value": "This handheld snare drum is adorned with garish scenes of battle and triumph. When played, no matter what rhythm, it always gives the impression of a marching beat, invoking armies on the move. While playing the drums, you gain a +1 item bonus to Performance checks and a +5-foot status bonus to your Speed.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from this instrument to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- - **2nd:** false life, sound burst, spiritual weapon\n- - **3rd:** haste, heroism"
